//Skirt: orange tabs at the front (her left) and the back, folded at the foot, edged in gold
# Tabs, measured on outlines traced over the sheet: each lies on the pleated skirt (x is measured across, so
# it follows the skirt's curve) and ends in a diagonal fold, the turned-back end hanging below it as a lighter
# flap. Front tab, on her left of the centre line: inner edge ftx(0,h) from 0.31 in to 0.14, outer edge widening
# from 0.5 to 0.87; folded from (0.14, 5.24) up to (0.87, 6.0), its point at (0.88, 4.5). Back tab, at the centre
# back: 0.34 wide at the waist, widening to 0.9; folded from 4.76 on her right up to 5.48 on her left, the flap
# narrowing to a point at 3.85 on her left. v runs across a tab, p down a part.
ftx(v,h)=0.14+0.065*(h-5.24)+(min(0.87,0.5+0.24*(8.5-h))-0.14-0.065*(h-5.24))*v
ffd(v)=5.24+0.76*v
ffb(v)=5.24-0.74*v
bhw(h)=0.17+0.28*(1-exp(-(8.1-h)/0.8))
btx(v,h)=-bhw(h)-0.12*max(0,(5.5-h)/0.74)+(2*bhw(h)+0.12*max(0,(5.5-h)/0.74))*v
btf(v,h)=-bhw(h)-0.12*max(0,(5.5-h)/0.74)+(0.4-0.05*(5.48-h)+bhw(h)+0.12*max(0,(5.5-h)/0.74))*v
bfd(v)=4.76+0.72*v
bfb(v)=4.76-0.91*v
# The tabs are cloth: each falls in two soft folds (tbf, how far the cloth stands off the skirt) that open from the waist to the foot, creased between them.
tbf(v,p)=0.075*(0.15+0.85*p)*(0.5-0.5*cos(4*pi*v))
(ftx(v,(8-(8-ffd(v))*p)),-(sa(sz((8-(8-ffd(v))*p)))+0.07+tbf(v,p))*dk(sz((8-(8-ffd(v))*p)),asin(min(0.97,ftx(v,(8-(8-ffd(v))*p))/(sa(sz((8-(8-ffd(v))*p)))+0.07+tbf(v,p)))))*cos(asin(min(0.97,ftx(v,(8-(8-ffd(v))*p))/(sa(sz((8-(8-ffd(v))*p)))+0.07+tbf(v,p))))),(8-(8-ffd(v))*p),p,0,1,v,0,1) | ref=frontTab color=#b65632
curve(ftx(0.5,8-(8-ffd(0.5))*t),-(sa(sz((8-(8-ffd(0.5))*t)))+0.075)*dk(sz((8-(8-ffd(0.5))*t)),asin(min(0.97,ftx(0.5,8-(8-ffd(0.5))*t)/(sa(sz((8-(8-ffd(0.5))*t)))+0.075))))*cos(asin(min(0.97,ftx(0.5,8-(8-ffd(0.5))*t)/(sa(sz((8-(8-ffd(0.5))*t)))+0.075)))),(8-(8-ffd(0.5))*t),t,0.08,1) | ref=frontTabCrease color=#863a21 thickness=2
(ftx(v,(ffd(v)-(ffd(v)-ffb(v))*p)),-(sa(sz((ffd(v)-(ffd(v)-ffb(v))*p)))+0.082+tbf(v,1-0.6*p))*dk(sz((ffd(v)-(ffd(v)-ffb(v))*p)),asin(min(0.97,ftx(v,(ffd(v)-(ffd(v)-ffb(v))*p))/(sa(sz((ffd(v)-(ffd(v)-ffb(v))*p)))+0.082+tbf(v,1-0.6*p)))))*cos(asin(min(0.97,ftx(v,(ffd(v)-(ffd(v)-ffb(v))*p))/(sa(sz((ffd(v)-(ffd(v)-ffb(v))*p)))+0.082+tbf(v,1-0.6*p))))),(ffd(v)-(ffd(v)-ffb(v))*p),p,0,1,v,0,1) | ref=frontTabFlap color=#c9713f
(ftx(v,(ffd(v)+0.04+0.07*p)),-(sa(sz((ffd(v)+0.04+0.07*p)))+0.078+tbf(v,1))*dk(sz((ffd(v)+0.04+0.07*p)),asin(min(0.97,ftx(v,(ffd(v)+0.04+0.07*p))/(sa(sz((ffd(v)+0.04+0.07*p)))+0.078+tbf(v,1)))))*cos(asin(min(0.97,ftx(v,(ffd(v)+0.04+0.07*p))/(sa(sz((ffd(v)+0.04+0.07*p)))+0.078+tbf(v,1))))),(ffd(v)+0.04+0.07*p),v,0,1,p,0,1) | ref=frontTabBorder color=#d9caa9
