//Cream lace-up ankle boots with block heels, from the three-view drawing
# Boots. A level of the upper at u (0..1, up the boot) is an oval: s = boc(u)-boa(u)*cos(p) back from
# the toe tip, x = sin(p)*sum bok_k(u)*cos(k*p) across, z = boz(u). Fitted to the drawing within 0.015.
